      "userJourney": "1. Select the travel details on the Fast Ferries website.\n2. Choose “Fast Checkout via EUDI Wallet” and scan the QR code.\n3. Review the linked bank account and the requested credentials: Photo ID, Student ID, or loyalty card.\n4. Consent to share the required information and confirm the payment in the wallet (pre-authorise €25 payment)\n5. Fast Ferries verifies the identity and student status, applies the discount and retrieves the required billing and contact information.\n6. The bank-issued payment authenticator is used to authenticate the payment securely.\n7. A green tick confirms that the transaction was successful.\n8. The e-receipt and boarding pass are issued as digital credentials and stored in the wallet.",
      "country": "SE"
